          "letter": "H",
          "english": "A recreation, however lifelike, will never be indistinguishable from a real actor, says Webber. \"When we are bringing someone back, representing someone who is no longer alive on the screen, what we are doing is extremely sophisticated digital make-up,\" he says: \"A performance is a lot more than a physical resemblance.\"",
